**Title:** github.com/ByteDance-AI/mcp-database-server: 基于MCP协议的数据库服务器
**URL:** https://github.com/ByteDance-AI/mcp-database-server

ByteDance AI's MCP Database Server implements the Model Context Protocol for database operations.

**Supported Databases:**
- PostgreSQL
- MySQL
- MariaDB
- SQLite
- MongoDB

**Features:**
- Natural language to SQL query conversion
- Schema exploration tools
- Safe query execution with parameterized queries
- Connection pooling
- Detailed documentation and examples

