737	    This function enables text wrapping and shrink text on overflow for text boxes
738	    that contain text longer than the specified threshold.
739	    
740	    Args:
741	        input_file: Path to the input PowerPoint file (.pptx)
742	        output_file: Path to save the processed file (optional, auto-generated if not provided)
743	        text_threshold: Text length threshold for enabling auto-fit (overrides .env setting)
744	        enable_autofit: Enable text auto-fitting (default: True)
745	    
